WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.780
Today we will recognise pulse and respectful listening. Our work connects with

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.069
selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:13.444
Listen to a short local rhythm and count its pulses. Name a design choice that a

00:00:13.444 --> 00:00:15.161
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.764
Echo the pulse by tapping softly four times.

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:23.340
Perform the pulse with a partner, starting and stopping together.
